## VISIBLE OUTCOME (LAW)
Every save/toggle/delete MUST show success and fail on the FE.
Public: mark the wrong input (red + message on the field). Build your own toast/status.
Never empty .after(), never alert().
Canonical: AIRULES/00-AGENT-CONTRACT.md §2d

## CONFIG / SECRETS
On new apps, generate c_enc_key, rm_key, rmrcm_key with bin2hex(random_bytes(32)).
/* @AUTOCONFIG */ does NOT auto-fill secrets.
Module settings MUST have fallbacks:
  Config::module("Mod","key") ?? Config::module("Mod","key", $default);

